ifecycle/SKILL.md:254 confirms delegation to skilllint\\n- Status: VERIFIED\\n- Evidence: Line 254 reads exactly: `- Does NOT validate frontmatter schema (that's \\\\`skilllint\\\\`)`\\n\\n**Claim 3**: Plugin-creator skills invoke `uvx skilllint@latest`\\n- Status: VERIFIED\\n- Evidence: Found in 40+ locations across plugin-creator skills. Examples: `skills/lint/SKILL.md:8` (`!\\\\`uvx skilllint@latest check $ARGUMENTS\\\\``), `skills/plugin-creator/SKILL.md:638`, `skills/plugin-lifecycle/SKILL.md:71,92,97,110,259,439,447,493,543,561`, `skills/agent-creator/SKILL.md:273,279,303,309`, `skills/write-frontmatter-description/SKILL.md:81,84`, `skills/refactor-skill/SKILL.md:31,238,408`.\\n\\n**Claim 4**: Local FrontmatterValidator is dead code (no active callers)\\n- Status: REFUTED\\n- Evidence: `FrontmatterValidator` is instantiated at `plugin_validator.py:4759` via `validators.append(FrontmatterValidator())` \u2014 it is part of the active validation pipeline. CLI test `test_cli.py:558` asserts `\\\"FrontmatterValidator\\\" in result.stdout`, confirming the CLI still outputs it. The class has dedicated tests in `test_frontmatter_validator.py` (30+ test cases) and integration tests in `test_hook_script_discovery.py:294,322`. The CLAUDE.md claims `plugin_validator.py | Removed \u2014 replaced by uvx skilllint@latest check` but the file and class physically exist and are functional \u2014 this is a doc/reality mismatch, not dead code.\\n\\n**Summary**: 2 VERIFIED, 1 REFUTED, 1 INCONCLUSIVE\\n\\nKey finding: The local `FrontmatterValidator` in `plugin_validator.py` is NOT dead code \u2014 it is actively used in the validation pipeline and tested. The CLAUDE.md description saying \\\"Removed \u2014 replaced by\\\" is inaccurate; the file still exists with the class at line 1849 and it is appended to the validators list at line 4759. The relationship between local `plugin_validator.py` and external `skilllint` needs clarification before any removal work proceeds.\\n</div>\\